  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Số tiền xây đường ống trên bờ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; số tiền xây đường ống dưới biển <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tổng chi phí bỏ ra để làm đường ống là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Theo giả thiết <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Phương trình đã cho tương đương <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Bình phương <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> vế của phương trình ta được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>120</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>225</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>15</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>75</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>25</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy vị trí <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> cách vị trí <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> một khoảng bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></semantics></math> km.",
